        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions STR5SMTSBR, Brass Sutter Ruler Pull with Round Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sutter Rectangular Brass Door Pull is a great contemporary pull for both commercial and residential doors. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. The Brass Sutter Ruler Pull with Round Mounts is made in the U.S.A..\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/sutter-rectangular-satin-stainless-steel-door-pull-first-impressions-str6smtss4bss\"><b>Stainless Steel Sutter Rectangular Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/sutter-rectangular-aluminum-door-pull-first-impressions-str4smtss4\"><b>Aluminum Sutter Rectangular Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Sutter Series 5 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-STR05-specifications.pdf?v=1704262331\"><b>First Impressions STR5SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>STR5012SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>STR5024SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>STR5036SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
